ove":"flight"}],"pacing":[{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:00Z","speed":1}],"beats":[{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:00Z","text":"Trump set to lurch further right, claiming US took ‘giant step back’ in elections, The Guardian reports.","cites":["news:guardian:aaa9539f5551"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:08Z","text":"During Trump's first term, the U.S. built 73 mi of wall in areas without barriers and 365 mi to replace older barriers.","cites":["wiki:rev:1384618282:205"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:16Z","text":"Donald John Trump (born June 14, 1946) is an American politician, media personality, and businessman who is the 47th president of the United States.","cites":["wiki:rev:1384618282:0"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:24Z","text":"Donald Trump was born on 14 June 1946 in Jamaica Hospital Medical Center.","cites":["wd:Q22686:P569","wd:Q22686:P19"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:32Z","text":"Educated at The Kew-Forest School, University of Pennsylvania, New York Military Academy and 2 more.","cites":["wd:Q22686:P69:Q7744153","wd:Q22686:P69:Q49117","wd:Q22686:P69:Q7013764","wd:Q22686:P69:Q130965","wd:Q22686:P69:Q1329269"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:44Z","text":"Worked for The Trump Organization, in New York City and Washington, D.C.","cites":["wd:Q22686:P108:Q2462124","wd:Q22686:P937:Q60","wd:Q22686:P937:Q61","wd:Q22686:P937:Q61"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:00:56Z","text":"29 awards on record, among them FIFA Peace Prize (2025) and Israel Prize (2026).","cites":["wd:Q22686:P166:Q6189894","wd:Q22686:P166:Q6189894"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:01:03Z","text":"Known for Trump: The Art of the Deal, Crippled America and The Apprentice.","cites":["wd:Q22686:P800:Q7847758","wd:Q22686:P800:Q21427293","wd:Q22686:P800:Q863122"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:01:10Z","text":"Native American women made significant gains in US midterms, The Guardian reports.","cites":["news:guardian:1822d242ab8e"]},{"t":"2026-11-08T00:01:17Z","text":"Small plane crashes into pickup truck on busy Florida highway, The Guardian reports.","cites":["news:guardian:bc46